# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unity project .gitignore
#
# Rule of thumb: everything under Assets/, Packages/ and ProjectSettings/ is
# source and IS committed (including every .meta file). Everything Unity or
# your IDE regenerates is not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Unity generated directories -------------------------------------------
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Nested variants (e.g. a package sandbox or a secondary project folder)
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Ll]ogs/

# Addressables build cache
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# Asset meta data for files that no longer exist is auto-pruned by Unity,
# but never ignore .meta files themselves:
!*.meta

# --- Generated C# project files --------------------------------------------
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# --- IDE noise --------------------------------------------------------------
# Visual Studio
.vs/
# Rider / JetBrains
.idea/
/[Rr]ider*/
*.sln.iml
# Visual Studio Code: keep the two files we deliberately share, drop the rest
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# --- Build output & packaged artifacts -------------------------------------
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.app
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
ExportedObj/
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt

# --- OS noise ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Secrets / licences: NEVER commit these --------------------------------
# Unity licence files and activation artifacts
*.ulf
*.alf
Unity_v*.alf
Unity_lic.ulf
# Generic secret containers
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
